1:00 AM ET AND ENDING BY 11:45 AM ET. THIS EVENT WILL BE WEBCAST, AND FOLLOWING THE CONCLUSION OF THE CONFERENCE A REPLAY W'}{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2021-11-19 08:00:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON ANNOUNCES REDEMPTION OF 1,000,000 DEPOSITARY SHARES, EACH REPRESENTING A 1/100TH INTEREST IN A SHARE OF ITS SERIES E NONCUMULATIVE PERPETUAL PREFERRED STOCK', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NOV. 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON CORPORATION ("BNY MELLON") (NYSE: BK) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL REDEEM ALL OUTSTANDING SHARES OF ITS SERIES E NONCUMULATIVE PERPETUAL PREFERRED STOCK (THE "SERIES E PREFERRED STOCK") AND ALL OF THE CORRESPONDING DEPOSITARY SHARES ("DEPOSITARY SHARES"), EACH REPRESENTING A 1/100TH INTEREST IN A SHARE OF THE SERIES E PREFERRED STOCK. THERE ARE CURRENTLY 10,000 SHARES OF SERIES E PREFERRED STOCK AND 1,000,000 DEPOSITARY SHARES OUTSTANDING.'}{'symbol': 'BMY', 'date': '2021-11-19 06:59:00', 'title': 'BRISTOL MYERS SQUIBB ANNOUNCES NEW PDUFA DATE FOR MAVACAMTEN', 'text': 'PRINCETON, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $BMY #FDA--BRISTOL MYERS SQUIBB ANNOUNCES NEW PDUFA DATE FOR MAVACAMTEN'}{'symbol': 'CINF', 'date': '2021-11-19 14:19:00', 'title': 'CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': "CINCINNATI, NOV. 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CINCINNATI FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CINF) ANNOUNCED THAT AT TODAY'S REGULAR MEETING, THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A 63-CENTS-PER-SHARE REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND. THE\xa0DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JANUARY 14, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF DECEMBER 16, 2021."}{'symbol': 'CTXS', 'date': '2021-11-19 18:10:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: BERNSTEIN LITOWITZ BERGER & GROSSMANN LLP ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC.', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NOV. 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, PROMINENT INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM BERNSTEIN LITOWITZ BERGER & GROSSMANN LLP ("BLB&G") FILED A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT FOR VIOLATIONS OF THE FEDERAL SECUR