GATION ON BEHALF OF ROLLINS, INC. (“ROLLINS” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: ROL) INVESTORS CONCERNING THE COMPANY'S POSSIBLE VIOLATIONS OF FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. ON OCTOBER 28, 2020, ROLLINS DISCLOSED THAT THE SEC “IS CONDUCTING AN INVESTIGATION, WHICH THE COMPANY BELIEVES IS PRIMARILY FOCUSED ON HOW IT ESTABLISHED ACCRUALS AND RESERVES AT PERIOD-ENDS AND THE IMPACT OF THOSE ACCRUALS AND RESERVES ON REPORTED EARNINGS"}{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2021-11-19 06:55:00', 'title': 'SEMPRA NAMED TO DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY WORLD INDEX FOR FOURTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, NOV. 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SEMPRA (NYSE: SRE) (BMV: SRE) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS AGAIN THE ONLY NORTH AMERICAN UTILITY SECTOR COMPANY TO BE NAMED TO THE DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY WORLD INDEX (DJSI WORLD), ONE OF THE MOST PRESTIGIOUS CORPORATE SUSTAINABILITY RANKINGS. THIS IS THE FOURTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR THAT THE COMPANY HAS BEEN LISTED ON THE DJSI WORLD INDEX.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2021-11-19 06:45:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES ANNOUNCES APPOINTMENT OF DAVID HESS AND CHRISTOPHER P. REYNOLDS TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'DALLAS, NOV. 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. (NYSE: LUV) HAS APPOINTED DAVID HESS AND CHRISTOPHER P. REYNOLDS AS MEMBERS OF THE BOARD.'}{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2021-11-19 09:00:00', 'title': 'STATE STREET HIRES VETERAN-OWNED FIRMS TO UNDERWRITE 2027 SENIOR NOTES OFFERING', 'text': "BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--STATE STREET CORPORATION (NYSE: STT) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WORKED WITH VETERAN-OWNED FIRMS ACTING AS BOOKRUNNERS AND CO-MANAGERS TO SYNDICATE A $500 MILLION SENIOR NOTE ISSUANCE. THE OFFERING, WHICH CLOSED YESTERDAY, REINFORCES THE FIRM'S COMMITMENT TO VETERANS AND THEIR FAMILIES AND OVERALL REPRESENTATION IN THE CAPITAL MARKETS AND BROADER FINANCIAL SERVICES INDUSTRY. IN THIS TRANSACTION, STATE STREET ISSUED FIXED-TO-FLOATING RATE SENIOR NOTES AT A COUPON OF 1.684 PE"}{'symbol': 'UNP', 'date': '2021-11-19 08:00:00', 'title': 'UNION PACIFIC CORPORATION CFO JENNIFER HAMANN TO ADDRESS THE STEPHENS ANNUAL INVESTMENT CONFERENCE 2021', 'text': 'OMAHA, NEB., NOV. 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JENNIFER HAMANN, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, OF UNION PACIFIC CORPORATION (NYSE: UNP), WILL ADDRESS THE STEPHENS ANNUAL INVESTMENT CONFERENCE 2021 AT 9:00 A.M.'}{'symbol': 'UNH', 'date': '2021-11-19 07:30:00', 'title': 'UNITED HEALTH FOUNDATION PARTNERS WITH HARRIS-STOWE STATE UNIVERSITY TO CREATE NEW BIOINFORMATICS PROGRAM', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE UNITED HEALTH FOUNDATION, THE PHILANTHROPIC FOUNDATION OF UNITEDHEALTH GROUP (NYSE: UNH), HAS AWARDED A $2 MILLION, THREE-YEAR GRANT TO HARRIS-STOWE STATE UNIVERSITY TO CREATE A BIOINFORMATICS PROGRAM FOR UNDERGRADUATE STUDENTS AT THE HISTORICALLY BLACK UNIVERSITY LOCATED IN ST. LOUIS. BIOINFORMATICS IS AN EMERGING FIELD THAT COMBINES SCIENCE, PHYSICS, MATH AND BIOLOGY TO AID IN THE DIAGNOSIS, TREATMENT AND DISCOVERY OF NEW THERAPEUTIC ADVANCEMENTS. AN EXAMPLE OF'}{'symbol': 'VTR', 'date': '2021-11-19 08:03:00', 'title': 'VENTAS CONTINUES ITS INDUSTRY ESG LEADERSHIP IN 2021', 'text': 'CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $VTR #CSA2021--VENTAS, INC. CONTINUES ITS INDUSTRY ESG LEADERSHIP EARNING ITS FIFTH CONSECUTIVE NAREIT HEALTH CARE “LEADER IN THE LIGHT” AWARD.'}{'symbol': 'VRTX', 'date': '2021-11-19 06:00:00', 'title': 'VERTEX ANNOUNCES REIMBURSEMENT AGREEMENT IN SPAIN FOR KAFTRIO® (IVACAFTOR/TEZACAFTOR/ELEXACAFTOR) IN COMBINATION WITH IVACAFTOR TO TREAT PEOPLE WITH CYSTIC FIBROSIS 12 YEARS AND OLDER WITH AT LEAST ONE F508DEL MUTATION IN THE CFTR GENE', 'text': 'LONDON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VERTEX PHARMACEUTICALS INCORPORATED (NASDAQ: VRTX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE SPANISH GOVERNMENT HAS APPROVED TERMS FOR THE NATIONAL REIMBURSEMENT OF KAFTRIO® (IVACAFTOR/TEZACAFTOR/ELEXACAFTOR) IN A COMBINATION REGIMEN WITH IVACAFTOR FOR THE TREATMENT OF CYSTIC FIBROSIS (CF) FOR ELIGIBLE PATIENTS. THE AGREEMENT COVERS PEOPLE WITH CF AGES 12 YEARS AND OLDER WHO HAVE AT LEAST ONE COPY OF THE F508DEL MUTATION, REGARDLESS OF THE OTHER MUTATION TYPE IN THE CFTR GENE. KAFTRIO®'}{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2021-11-19 19:13:00', 'title': 'WALGREENS NOW PROVIDING ALL COVID-19 VACCINE BOOSTERS FOR INDIVIDUALS AGES 18 AND OLDER', 'text': "DEERFIELD, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WALGREENS ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ALL INDIVIDUALS OVER THE AGE OF 18 CAN NOW RECEIVE A PFIZER, MODERNA OR JOHNSON & JOHNSON COVID-19 VACCINE BOOSTER IN STORES NATIONWIDE. THIS FOLLOWS THE FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION'S (FDA) RECENT DECISION TO EXPAND EMERGENCY USE AUTHORIZATION FOR PFIZER AND MODERNA BOOSTER VACCINES TO ALL INDIVIDUALS 18 AND OLDER, IN ADDITION TO NEW GUIDANCE FROM THE CENTERS FOR DISEASE CONTROL AND PREVENTION (CDC). INDIVIDUALS CAN SCHEDULE"}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2021-11-19 21:22:00', 'title': 'WELLS FARGO INVESTIGATION CONTINUED BY FORMER LOUISIANA ATTORNEY GENERAL: KAHN SWICK & FOTI, LLC CONTINUES TO INVESTIGATE THE OFFICERS AND DIRECTORS OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY - WFC', 'text': 'NEW ORLEANS, NOV. 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FORMER ATTORNEY GENERAL OF LOUISIANA, CHARLES C. FOTI, JR., ESQ.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2021-11-19 08:00:00', 'title': 'WELLS FARGO & COMPANY DECLARES CASH DIVIDENDS ON PREFERRED STOCK', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE: WFC) TODAY ANNOUNCED DIVIDENDS ON EIGHT SERIES OF PREFERRED STOCK. A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $18.75 PER SHARE WAS DECLARED ON ITS 7.50% NONCUMULATIVE PERPETUAL CONVERTIBLE CLASS A PREFERRED STOCK, SERIES L, LIQUIDATION PREFERENCE $1,000 PER SHARE, WHICH IS TRADED ON THE NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE UNDER THE SYMBOL “WFCPRL”. THE SERIES L DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON DEC. 15, 2021, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOV. 3'}